  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Best Mushroom Gravy",
  "description": "This rich mushroom gravy is made from scratch with mushrooms, beef stock, and thyme for a delicious gravy on mashed potatoes, meatloaf, or any roast.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
